## Your Task

Analyze ALL feedback and produce a JSON response with exactly this structure:

```json
{
  "overallAssessment": "2-3 sentence overall assessment of the candidate",
  "keyStrengths": ["strength 1 with evidence", "strength 2 with evidence", "..."],
  "areasOfConcern": ["concern 1 with evidence", "concern 2 with evidence", "..."],
  "skillAnalysis": [
    {
      "skillName": "skill name",
      "category": "TECHNICAL|LEADERSHIP|BEHAVIOURAL|COMMUNICATION|DOMAIN",
      "averageRating": 4.0,
      "assessment": "brief assessment with interviewer evidence"
    }
  ],
  "recommendation": "hire|conditional_hire|do_not_hire",
  "confidence": "high|medium|low",
  "riskFactors": ["risk 1", "risk 2"]
}
```

Rules:
- Base your assessment strictly on the provided feedback data
- Reference specific interviewer observations when citing strengths or concerns
- confidence should reflect consensus: "high" if interviewers mostly agree, "medium" if mixed, "low" if strongly conflicting
- riskFactors should identify things that could go wrong post-hire based on concerns raised
- Return ONLY the JSON object, no additional text